<p>Due to my use of ad blockers and PiHole I did not know that <a href="https://www.nomadicbackpacker.com/disqus-comments-removed-for-better-user-experience.html">Disqus injects ads into your site if you use their comment section</a>. Looking on my phone the other day, I was horrified to see <strong>TWELVE ADS</strong> on my articles, all of which are utter <strong>TRASH</strong>.</p>
<p>The only ads I will ever allow are for products that I personally use and recommend, that is my promise to those that read my blog, or watch my <a href="https://www.youtube.com/joshuablais">Youtube content</a>.</p>
<p>So, I am pulling Disqus from my site, never to return.</p>
<p>This means that I will not have a comment section on my site for the time being, and I don’t really mind - but for those that have left comments: <a href="mailto:josh@joshblais.com">email me</a>!  I enjoy emailing back and forth with people and it also gives me ideas for future articles or videos.</p>
<p>As always, God bless, and until next time.</p>
